ALLOW_DATETIME_FORMAT — the probe needs precision down to the second to line up a screen lock with the automation that fired next to it, so Format Date deliberately uses a custom date AND time pattern rather than a date-only string.

- Get Device Details is set to Device Is Locked
- Date is left on Current Date so it stamps the exact moment of the run
- Format Date takes its Date from the Date action above</string>
